{
  "info": {
    "name": "TicketHub Pro API v1.0",
    "_postman_id": "tickethub-pro-v1-improved",
    "description": "# TicketHub Pro API **Version**: v1.0 — JWT Bearer Token Authentication **Base URL**: `{{baseUrl}}` **Auth**: Bearer Token (stored in collection variable after login) --- ## Quick Start 1. เลือก Environment ที่ต้องการ (Development / Staging) 2. Run **POST Login** — token จะ save อัตโมัติ 3. ทุก request จะใช้ `{{token}}` โดยอัตโมัติ --- ## Roles - `USER` — สร้างและติดตาม Ticket ของตัวเอง - `MANAGER` — อุมัติ / รับมอบหมาย / Private Ticket - `ADMIN` — จัดการ Users, Departments, Webhooks, Analytics --- ## ️ Notes - Token หมดอายุใ **24 ชั่วโมง** — Login ใหม่เพื่อรับ Token - Endpoints ที่ระบุ `(ADMIN only)` ต้องใช้บัญชี ADMIN - `{{ticketId}}`, `{{userId}}`, `{{deptId}}` จะถูก save อัตโมัติหลัง request แรก",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000/api",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API Base URL — เปลี่ยตาม environment"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT Access Token — auto-set หลัง Login"
    },
    {
      "key": "ticketId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Ticket ID — auto-set หลัง Create/Get Ticket"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "User ID — auto-set หลัง Get Users"
    },
    {
      "key": "deptId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Department ID — auto-set หลัง Get Departments"
    },
    {
      "key": "webhookId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Webhook ID — auto-set หลัง Get Webhooks"
    },
    {
      "key": "notifId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Notification ID — auto-set หลัง Get Notifications"
    },
    {
      "key": "commentId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Comment ID — auto-set หลัง Add Comment"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "JWT-based authentication endpoints Login ก่อเสมอ — token จะถูก save ลง `{{token}}` อัตโมัติ",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Login และรับ JWT Token** Token จะถูก save ลง `{{token}}` อัตโมัติ **Rate Limit**: 15 attempts / 15 minutes **Test Credentials**: - Admin: `admin` / `password123` - Manager: `manager` / `password123` - Employee: `employee` / `password123` **Response**: `{ status, data: { id, email, username, name, role, token } }`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**ดึงข้อมูล Profile ของผู้ใช้ปัจจุบั** จาก JWT Token Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"ชื่อที่อัปเดตใหม่\",\n  \"avatarUrl\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**แก้ไข name และ avatarUrl** ของผู้ใช้ปัจจุบัน Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Logout** — เคลียร์ token ออกจาก collection variables ℹ️ JWT เป็ stateless — server ไม่มี session ให้ลบ client ต้องลบ token เอง Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tickets",
      "description": "Ticket management endpoints **Access Control by Role**: - `USER` — เห็เฉพาะ Ticket ที่ตัวเองสร้าง - `MANAGER` — เห็ Ticket ของแผกตัวเอง - `ADMIN` — เห็ Ticket ทั้งหมด",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Tickets",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**ดึง Tickets ทั้งหมด** ตามสิทธิ์ของ user **Role-based filtering**: - `USER` → เฉพาะ tickets ของตัวเอง - `MANAGER` → tickets ของแผก + ที่รับมอบหมาย - `ADMIN` → ทุก ticket ใระบบ Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**ดึง Ticket ตาม ID** **Path Parameter**: `ticketId` — auto-set จาก Get All Tickets Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ticket Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/data",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "data"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**ดึงรายละเอียด Ticket พร้อม Comments และ Timeline** Response รวม: - `ticket` — ข้อมูล ticket ครบถ้ว + SLA - `comments` — ทุก comment รวม system logs Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Chat Updates",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/chat-updates",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "chat-updates"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Real-time Polling** — ดึง comments ล่าสุดและสถาะ ticket ใช้สำหรับ frontend polling ทุก N วิาที เพื่ออัปเดต chat Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"คอมพิวเตอร์เปิดไม่ติด\",\n  \"description\": \"เครื่องดับกะทัหั ไม่สามารถเปิดใหม่ได้ ไฟสัญญาณไม่ขึ้\",\n  \"category\": \"HARDWARE\",\n  \"subcategory\": \"computer_laptop\",\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"targetDepartmentId\": \"{{deptId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**สร้าง Ticket ใหม่** ส่งไปยัง Department **Required Fields**: `title`, `category` **category enum**: `HARDWARE` `SOFTWARE` `NETWORK` `ACCESS` `OTHER` **priority enum**: `LOW` `MEDIUM` `HIGH` `CRITICAL` **subcategory enum** (ตัวอย่าง): `computer_laptop` `monitor` `printer_scanner` `accessory` `hardware_other` `os_system` `office_apps` `internal_systems` `install_update` `software_other` `wifi_issue` `lan_issue` `vpn_remote` `slow_network` `network_other` `password_reset` `shared_folder` `license_request` `keycard_building` `access_other` `desk_chair` `stationery` `intern_coord` `consultation` `other_general` Auth Required: Bearer Token (any role)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Private Ticket (MANAGER→MANAGER)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"เรื่องส่วตัว Manager-to-Manager\",\n  \"description\": \"เรื่องที่ต้องการส่งตรงถึง Manager อีกค (ไม่ผ่าแผก)\",\n  \"category\": \"OTHER\",\n  \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n  \"receiverManagerId\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**สร้าง Private Ticket** ส่งตรงถึง Manager คอื่ ️ **MANAGER role เท่าั้** **ข้อกำหด**: - Sender ต้องเป็ `MANAGER` - `receiverManagerId` ต้องเป็ user ที่มี role `MANAGER` - Ticket จะ **ไม่ปรากฏ** ใ department tickets Auth Required: Bearer Token (MANAGER only)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Comment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"ขอบคุณสำหรับการตอบกลับ จะรอดำเิการต่อ\",\n  \"isInternal\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "comments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**เพิ่ม Comment** ใ Ticket **isInternal**: - `false` — ข้อความสาธารณะ (ทุกคเห็) - `true` — หมายเหตุ ายใ Agent/Admin เท่าั้ ️ ไม่สามารถ comment ใ Ticket ที่ `CANCELLED` หรือ `CLOSED` Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Ticket Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"approvalNote\": \"รับทราบและเริ่มดำเิการแล้ว\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**อัปเดตสถาะ Ticket** ️ *Note: Method ควรเป็ PATCH ตามมาตรฐา REST แต่ Backend ปัจจุบัใช้ POST* **status enum**: | Value | ความหมาย | |-------|----------| | `NEW` | รอดำเิการ | | `IN_PROGRESS` | กำลังดำเิการ | | `PENDING_APPROVAL` | รออุมัติ | | `APPROVED` | อุมัติแล้ว | | `REJECTED` | ปฏิเสธ | | `FORWARDED` | ส่งต่อแผก | | `WAITING_PARTS` | รออะไหล่ | | `RESOLVED` | เสร็จสิ้ | | `CLOSED` | ปิดถาวร | | `CANCELLED` | ยกเลิก (เฉพาะ creator) | Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"approvalAction\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"approvalNote\": \"อุมัติคำขอเรียบร้อย\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**อุมัติ Ticket** (MANAGER / ADMIN) **approvalAction**: `APPROVE` หลังอุมัติ status จะเปลี่ยเป็ `APPROVED` → `IN_PROGRESS` อัตโมัติ Auth Required: Bearer Token (MANAGER / ADMIN)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"approvalAction\": \"REJECT\",\n  \"approvalNote\": \"ไม่อุมัติเื่องจากข้อมูลไม่ครบถ้ว กรุณาแบเอกสารเพิ่มเติม\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**ปฏิเสธ Ticket** (MANAGER / ADMIN) **approvalAction**: `REJECT` Auth Required: Bearer Token (MANAGER / ADMIN)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"agentId\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "assign"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**มอบหมาย Ticket ให้ Agent** หรือกด self-assign ️ *Note: Method ควรเป็ PATCH ตามมาตรฐา REST แต่ Backend ปัจจุบัใช้ POST* Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Transfer Ticket",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"toDepartmentId\": \"{{deptId}}\",\n  \"note\": \"ส่งต่อไปยังแผกที่รับผิดชอบโดยตรง\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/transfer",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tickets",
                "{{ticketId}}",
                "transfer"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**ส่งต่อ Ticket** ไปยัง Department อื่ ️ *Note: Method ควรเป็ PATCH ตามมาตรฐา REST แต่ Backend ปัจจุบัใช้ POST* Auth Required: Bearer Token"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
